---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import Btn from './Btn.astro';
---
<section class="section bg-dots" style="background-color:var(--bg-2)">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div class="rv">
      <span class="label">(01) About Us</span>
      <h2 class="h-lg reveal-text" style="margin-bottom:28px">Elevating brands online and on the streets of Dubai.</h2>
      <p>At <strong>Limeflock</strong>, we don't just build websites - we build demand. From custom websites and SEO to billboards, metro and LED truck campaigns, we connect every channel your customers see.</p>
      <p>We believe great marketing starts with understanding your business. That's why we work closely with every client to understand their goals, audience and numbers - and report on what matters: leads, sales and growth.</p>
      <div class="founder">
        <div class="stack">
          <img src="/img/theme/t1-author-6.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/img/theme/t1-author-7.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/img/theme/t1-author-8.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h5>Limeflock Team</h5>
          <small>Strategists · Designers · Media buyers</small>
        </div>
        <span class="sep"></span>
        <Btn href="/contact/">Get in touch</Btn>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mv-cards">
      <div class="mv-stack"><div class="card mv-card">
        <Icon name="target" class="ico" />
        <h4>Our Mission</h4>
        <p>Help businesses stand out online and offline, tell their story, and drive measurable growth through creativity and smart media.</p>
      </div></div>
      <div class="mv-stack"><div class="card mv-card">
        <Icon name="eye" class="ico" />
        <h4>Our Vision</h4>
        <p>To be the UAE's most trusted growth partner - where design, technology, AI and outdoor media work as one.</p>
      </div></div>
      <div class="mv-stack"><div class="card mv-card">
        <Icon name="users" class="ico" />
        <h4>Collaborate with Us</h4>
        <p>Let's build something extraordinary - from high-converting websites to city-wide campaigns that get people talking.</p>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
